<title>BELGIUM: EU approves Tenneco buy of KNP BT unit.</title>
<headline>EU approves Tenneco buy of KNP BT unit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had approved a plan by U.S. company Tenneco to buy the protective and flexible packaging division of KNP BT.</p>
<p>Tenneco, which produces and sells packaging products and automotive exhaust and shock absorption systems, announced in March it had agreed to buy the division from the Dutch paper and packaging company for $375 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The formalities were formalised last week,&quot; a KNP BT spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
